  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building and Education Reform Kosovo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kapacitetsst&#xF6;d och utbildningsreform Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xE5;let med insatsen &#xE4;r att presentera en enhetlig utbildningspolicy f&#xF6;r regeringen, baserad p&#xE5; senaste studierna inom sektorn och i samr&#xE5;de med ber&#xF6;rda parter. Konsulterna ska tillsammans med  utbildningsministeriet ta fram en implementeringsplan f&#xF6;r &#xE5;ren 2010-2015 med f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad budgetering och finansiering, inklusive givarst&#xF6;det till sektorn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to present the Government with a proposed comprehensive policy for the education sector in Kosovo based on available policy papers and consultations with stakeholders in Kosovo. The consultants shall together with Ministry of Education, Science and Technology, prepare an implementation plan for 2010-2015, with improved sector budgeting and financing of the prioritized needs.</narrative>
  </description>
